// (ProcessEvent detour, engine-tick detour, the cost table) and skips the co-op
// ticks entirely, so one run measures the GAME ALONE at the same spot and the
// difference between two runs is exactly what the module costs.  It is a test
// instrument, not a feature flag: nothing else reads it, and it is only sampled
// once, at Start().
